{"id":"composer_000018","name":"罗伯特·舒曼","originalName":"Robert Schumann","aliases":["舒曼","罗伯特.舒曼","Robert Schumann","Schumann"],"birthYear":1810,"deathYear":1856,"nationality":"德国","period":"浪漫主义","introduction":"德国浪漫主义作曲家、乐评人，《新音乐杂志》创办人。他以钢琴套曲确立了自己最私密的文体——短小性格小品串联成诗意的整体，《童年情景》《克莱斯勒偶记》《幻想曲》皆是代表。与克拉拉·舒曼的爱情与婚姻是音乐史上的著名篇章，晚年精神疾病缠身，享年四十六岁。","styleSummary":"诗意、内省、冲动，善用节奏动机与文字联想，钢琴写作充满幻想气质。","completeness":"complete","status":"published","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T12:00:00.000Z","sources":[{"id":"wikipedia-en-robert-schumann","title":"Robert Schumann","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Schumann","publisher":"English Wikipedia","accessedAt":"2026-08-27","supports":["name","birthYear","deathYear","nationality","period","introduction"]}],"works":[{"id":"work_000048","composerId":"composer_000018","composerName":"罗伯特·舒曼","title":"《童年情景》","originalTitle":"Kinderszenen, Op. 15","opus":"Op. 15","genre":"钢琴套曲","periodKey":"romantic","genreFamily":"solo","durationMinutes":17,"difficulty":"第一次听","tags":["舒曼","钢琴套曲","浪漫主义","童年","梦幻曲"],"summary":"舒曼1838年写给克拉拉的十三首钢琴小品，以成人的乡愁回望童年，第七首《梦幻曲》成为世界上被演奏最多的钢琴小品之一。","upcomingEventIds":["perf_b288f08773faa14c","perf_d33f9ef59feb68e9"],"upcomingEventCount":2},{"id":"work_000049","composerId":"composer_000018","composerName":"罗伯特·舒曼","title":"C大调幻想曲","originalTitle":"Fantasie in C major, Op. 17","opus":"Op. 17","genre":"钢琴奏鸣曲／幻想曲","periodKey":"romantic","genreFamily":"chamber","durationMinutes":29,"difficulty":"适合深入","tags":["舒曼","钢琴","浪漫主义","幻想曲","克拉拉"],"summary":"舒曼在与克拉拉分离最痛苦的日子里写成的钢琴巨作，三个乐章从火山般的激情到近乎透明的告别，末乐章引用了贝多芬《致远方的爱人》。","upcomingEventIds":["perf_2a203fb9aad9c7ff","perf_d33f9ef59feb68e9"],"upcomingEventCount":2}],"upcomingEventIds":["perf_b288f08773faa14c","perf_2a203fb9aad9c7ff","perf_d33f9ef59feb68e9"],"upcomingEventCount":3}